  "issue": {
    "body": "in update 0.42.0 an extra indent was added to line 158 in staticfiles.py and this broke the symlinks, which leads to the error:\n\n```\nif os.path.commonpath([full_path, directory]) != directory:\n       ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"<frozen ntpath>\", line 850, in commonpath\nValueError: Paths don't have the same drive\n```\n\non the current version 0.45.3 this is not fixed\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/48ec31f9-2c7d-41f5-aa34-b0808be04cd7)",
